> - Grima then unrolls an **aged, hand‑drawn map** of the region:
>   - Marked features:
>     - **Stone Tooth Range** (low mountains/hills to cross).
>     - **The Greenwood** forest (edge of the druid lands).
>     - A **River Fork** leading toward the canyon and Sky‑Temple (“Storm Temple” or similar on the map).
>     - A crude symbol of swirling clouds over a deep cleft: **The Canyon of Storms**.
